- Architects and dev leads deciding when to extend Power Platform solutions with Azure Functions.{{link|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67736930/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67736930/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266}}
