- Compliance, risk and audit stakeholders who expect long‑term, provable monitoring.{{link|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67646241/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67646241/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266}}
- Leaders evaluating if Sentinel is an expensive luxury or a necessary layer in their {{link|https://www.m365.fm/categories/security-talk/|security}} stack.{{link|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67646241/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67646241/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266}}

