- Security, compliance and data protection officers working with BSI‑regulated environments.{{link|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67640587/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67640587/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266}}
- Architects and project managers who need Microsoft 365 to be both modern and audit‑ready from day one.{{link|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67640587/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67640587/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266}}

