- SharePoint, Teams and Microsoft 365 admins planning intranets and collaboration spaces.{{link|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67627755/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67627755/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266}}
- Business stakeholders who had a bad SharePoint experience years ago and need a fresh picture.{{link|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67627755/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67627755/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266}}

