- Data leaders and BI managers deciding how far to lean into AI‑generated reports.{{link|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67609481/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67609481/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266}}
