- Compliance and risk officers who want evidence that controls are enforced continuously, not just on paper.{{link|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67455991/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67455991/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266}}
- IT leaders who need a single, authoritative view of cloud compliance posture they can take to executives and auditors.{{link|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67455991/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67455991/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266}}

