- Microsoft 365 admins who want a clearer understanding of who is doing what in their tenant.{{link|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67392349/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67392349/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266}}
- IT leaders who need a practical, non‑overwhelming way to bring audit review into regular operations.{{link|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67392349/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67392349/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266}}

