ifically for the meeting surface. You’ll learn how manifest design, deep links, and context parameters turn generic web apps into meeting‑aware experiences that automatically pick the right team, project, or record without users clicking through menus. We talk about UI consistency, single sign‑on, and permission prompts that either make your app feel native—or instantly break trust if handled poorly. WHAT YOU LEARN
