- Solution architects deciding when to invest in bots, tabs, message extensions—or all three.{{link|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67352748/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67352748/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266}}
