- IT leaders who worry more about internal oversharing and misconfigurations than dramatic zero‑day exploits.{{link|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67326842/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67326842/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266}}

