- Developers and platform teams who want to bring DevOps practices—scripts, versioning, repeatable deployments—into Power Platform.{{link|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67311542/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67311542/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266}}
